+/* The gilding: one gold sweep across a card the moment a quick-add is CONFIRMED by
+   the store, so "it's yours now" is felt on the card itself rather than only in the
+   button and the toast. Same family as the art shimmer, but gold, one-shot, and
+   TRANSFORM-driven rather than background-position - this can fire on several tiles
+   in a burst, and a paint-phase animation there would raster each tile every frame
+   (§6). The overlay unmounts itself on animationend. */
+.cx-gilt-glimmer { position: absolute; inset: 0; overflow: hidden; pointer-events: none; border-radius: 12px; }
+.cx-gilt-glimmer::after {
+  content: ''; position: absolute; top: -25%; bottom: -25%; left: -70%; width: 60%;
